@startuml

title Agentic Workflow Generator — Domain overview

left to right direction

rectangle "Setup and selection\n\nProject\nSetup\nProfile" as SELECTION

rectangle "Agent composition\n\nBundle\nAgentInstance\nRoleBinding\nSeparationPolicy" as COMPOSITION

rectangle "Workflow control\n\nWorkflow\nState\nTransition\nGate" as WORKFLOW

rectangle "Capabilities, evidence and targets\n\nSkill\nCapability\nArtifactContract\nPermissionProfile\nTargetAdapter" as SUPPORT

SELECTION --> COMPOSITION : selects bundle
SELECTION --> SUPPORT : selects targets
COMPOSITION --> WORKFLOW : binds ownership
COMPOSITION --> SUPPORT : selects and produces
WORKFLOW --> SUPPORT : requires capabilities and evidence

note bottom
CompiledComposition is the derived compiler authority.
It is not a separate conceptual registry entity.
end note

@enduml
